{#
    The signature on the emails that speak as "me" (EmailService::ENQUIRY_SIGNATURE,
    exactly as confirmed 13 October 2026): the enquiry email, and for an enquiry the
    quote and the balance request (Step 7c.4). Straight after the opening (and any
    personal note), before the numbered sections. Needs the layout's body style.
#}
<div data-email-signature>
{% for paragraph in constant('App\\Service\\EmailService::ENQUIRY_SIGNATURE')|split("\n\n") %}
<p style="{{ body }}">{{ paragraph|nl2br }}</p>
{% endfor %}
</div>
